    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the classic card game of concentration! This is a 2-player game. First, P1 picks two cards, then P2 picks two cards, then P1 again, then P2... this repeats until all cards have been paired off. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As for controls, you only need to move the cursor and left-click things. Oh right, you can also use ESC on your keyboard to pause the match, or to skip the card-shuffling intro that plays at the beginning of each match.</p>",
